#: ../../source/docs/hold-mode.rst:5 da5252c5c2c5431c8606a10984555f70
msgid "Hold Mode"
msgstr "Hold 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/hold-mode.rst:7 b2911d85b2304d7d9392bc5372ad985e
msgid ""
"In Hold mode the vehicle should stop and for regular steering-throttle "
"rovers, the steering will point straight ahead."
msgstr "在 Hold 模式下，车辆应停止；对于普通转向-油门 Rover，转向将指向正前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/hold-mode.rst:9 06ddca23f0ff439c970808b35fa78a45
msgid ""
"This is a good mode to :ref:`Arm and Disarm <arming-your-rover>` the vehicle"
" in because the transmitter inputs required to arm/disarm will not affect "
"the steering or motors."
msgstr "这是 :ref:`解锁和加锁 <arming-your-rover>` 车辆的好模式，因为解锁/加锁所需的发射器输入不会影响转向或电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/hold-mode.rst:11 eb9f6c3ba1b7486c9d0647feadcc1a2c
msgid ""
"The various :ref:`Failsafe <rover-failsafes>` features are often setup to "
"switch the vehicle into this mode."
msgstr "各种 :ref:`失控保护 <rover-failsafes>` 功能通常设置为将车辆切换到此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/hold-mode.rst:13 13e1403076aa4995ab1fb330304357fd
msgid ""
"The output to the :ref:`servo and motors <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration>` will be the values held in the SERVOx_TRIM parameters (i.e. "
":ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`, :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`舵机和电机 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>` 的输出将为 SERVOx_TRIM "
"参数中保存的值（即 :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`、:ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>`）"
